* 2\. Diagnosis of type 1 and type 2 diabetes;
* 3\. History of malignant tumors;
* 4\. Serious liver dysfunction or chronic kidney disease (AST or ALT \> 3 times the upper limit of normal, or eGFR\<30 ml/min/1.73 m2);
